.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "skillastic suggest" 1  "skillastic suggest " 
.SH NAME
skillastic suggest \- Ask an inference backend for skill refinement suggestions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskillastic suggest\fR [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISKILL\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ask an inference backend for skill refinement suggestions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
Model override for the inference backend
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISKILL\fR]
Suggest for one skill (default: every skill the review flags)
